    <label>steel wyvern</label>
    <description>Short, dense, and on fire. Haiku carries the heaviest hull in the light class - layer upon layer of plating over a diabolus-grade frame - and answers every question in bursts: charge blasts and plasma volleys from the mouth, supporting laser fire from the back, and a bite that leaves the target burning. Seventeen syllables: approach, ignite, repeat.</description>
